From: openRuyi Project Contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Load the structure fixture with an explicit package pattern

An empty package pattern no longer selects the working directory with the
current Go toolchain. Load "." so the suite still inspects the fixture's
syntax and type information and runs all field assertions.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Upstream: https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/go-exhaustruct

diff --git a/internal/structure/fields_test.go b/internal/structure/fields_test.go
--- a/internal/structure/fields_test.go
+++ b/internal/structure/fields_test.go
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@ func (s *StructFieldsSuite) SetupSuite() {
 	pkgs, err := packages.Load(&packages.Config{ //nolint:exhaustruct
 		Mode: packages.NeedTypes | packages.NeedTypesInfo | packages.NeedTypesSizes | packages.NeedSyntax,
 		Dir:  "testdata",
-	}, "")
+	}, ".")
 	s.Require().NoError(err)
 	s.Require().Len(pkgs, 1)
 
